## Proposed Changes

### Database [schema.prisma](file:///home/melwinabi/Documents/Smart_Hub/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Add `totpSecret` to `AdminEmail`.
- Add `lastValue` to [Widget](file:///home/melwinabi/Documents/Smart_Hub/src/app/dashboard/page.tsx#13-18).

### Admin Auth Flow
1. Admin enters email.
2. System sends Email OTP (for setup/verification).
3. If TOTP not set up: Show QR Code + Secret. Admin scans in Google Authenticator.
4. If TOTP set up: Admin enters 6-digit code from Google Authenticator.
5. Login success.

